@startuml
!include common-theme.puml
title 工厂方法模式：统一创建不同来源的日程事件

package "调用端" {
  class ScheduleService
}

package "工厂层" {
  abstract class ScheduleEventCreator {
    +create(payload): ScheduleEvent
    #fill_common_fields(payload)
  }

  class CourseEventCreator
  class ActivityEventCreator
  class PersonalEventCreator
}

package "产物" {
  class ScheduleEvent {
    +title
    +type
    +start_time
    +end_time
    +location
    +color_type
  }
}

ScheduleEventCreator <|-- CourseEventCreator
ScheduleEventCreator <|-- ActivityEventCreator
ScheduleEventCreator <|-- PersonalEventCreator

ScheduleService --> ScheduleEventCreator : 按 type 选择具体创建器
CourseEventCreator ..> ScheduleEvent : create()
ActivityEventCreator ..> ScheduleEvent : create()
PersonalEventCreator ..> ScheduleEvent : create()

note right of ScheduleService
课表导入、活动加入日程、手工新增日程
都复用统一的创建入口。
end note
@enduml
